{"id":57337,"date":"2026-08-06T10:43:26","date_gmt":"2026-08-06T09:43:26","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-entre-pontes-tavira\/"},"modified":"2026-09-02T20:08:46","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T19:08:46","slug":"corrida-entre-pontes-tavira","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-entre-pontes-tavira\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida Entre Pontes \u00e0 Tavira 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida Entre Pontes \u00e0 Tavira 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida Entre Pontes &#8211; Cidade de Tavira 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>20 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, na charmosa e hist\u00f3rica cidade de <strong>Tavira<\/strong>, no <strong>Algarve<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Faro<\/strong>). Promovida pelo <strong>Clube de Vela de Tavira<\/strong> em parceria com a <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Algarve (AAA)<\/strong> e o apoio do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Tavira<\/strong>, a prova \u00e9 um dos eventos de atletismo de estrada mais aguardados do sotavento algarvio.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com centro de opera\u00e7\u00f5es na emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Pra\u00e7a da Rep\u00fablica<\/strong> e <strong>Rua Jos\u00e9 Pires Padinha<\/strong>, as corridas jovens iniciam-se \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> (550 m a 1.920 m com inscri\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita), antecedendo o tiro de partida da <strong>Corrida Principal de 10.300 metros<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09:45<\/strong>. O percurso plano e r\u00e1pido contorna as margens do Rio Gil\u00e3o e Rio S\u00e9qua, atravessando a ic\u00f3nica Ponte Romana, Ponte de Santiago, Ponte de S\u00e3o Domingos e Ponte do Gil\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">20 de Setembro de 2026 \u0