realiza a Corrida Entre Pontes Tavira 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A corrida realiza-se no domingo, 20 de setembro de 2026, com secretariado, partida e meta na Pra\u00e7a da Rep\u00fablica e Rua Jos\u00e9 Pires Padinha, em Tavira.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e escal\u00f5es em disputa?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova principal tem a extens\u00e3o de 10.300 m (Juniores a Veteranos), havendo ainda corridas de 550 m (Sub-10), 1.100 m (Sub-12 e Sub-14) e 1.920 m (Sub-16 e Sub-18).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es para os escal\u00f5es jovens s\u00e3o pagas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">N\u00e3o, as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es para todos os escal\u00f5es de forma\u00e7\u00e3o (Benjamins a Juvenis) s\u00e3o totalmente gratuitas at\u00e9 ao dia 15 de setembro.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se situam os balne\u00e1rios de apoio aos atletas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os participantes t\u00eam \u00e0 disposi\u00e7\u00e3o balne\u00e1rios e duches no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal Dr. Eduardo Mansinho, com acesso exterior pelas traseiras do edif\u00edcio.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Por que pontes passa o percurso da corrida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tra\u00e7ado de 10,3 km atravessa as principais pontes de Tavira sobre o Rio Gil\u00e3o e Rio S\u00e9qua: Ponte Romana, Ponte de Santiago, Ponte de S\u00e3o Domingos e Ponte Gil\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Corrida Entre Pontes \u00e0 Tavira 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-20\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pra\u00e7a da Rep\u00fablica \/ Rua Jos\u00e9 Pires Padinha\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Tavira\", \"addressRegion\": \"Faro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Clube de Vela de Tavira \/ AA Algarve \/ Munic\u00edpio de Tavira\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se rea